config SUNXI_TVPANEL
	tristate "Allwinner H726 tvpanel (DSI/LVDS/TCON) support"
	depends on OF
	depends on COMMON_CLK
	help
	  Display panel framework for the Allwinner H726 (sun50iw15p1) TV
	  output block: MIPI DSI controller, combo D-PHY, LVDS transmitter and
	  the timing controller (TCON).

	  Panel drivers (SUNXI_PANEL_LVDS_GEN, SUNXI_PANEL_DSI_GEN,
	  SUNXI_PANEL_Z20HD720M) bind to the panel ABI exported by this module.

	  Say Y here; the module is loaded by the display bring-up sequence.
